payload.message:
No. `Key=Value,Key=Value` is **not JSON object syntax**.

- It is valid only as a **string value** in JSON, e.g.:
```json
{
  "name": "EN=21/80MN,RU=21/80МН,ZH_HANS=21/80MN"
}
```

- If you want real JSON key/value data type, use an object:
```json
{
  "name": {
    "EN": "21/80MN",
    "RU": "21/80МН",
    "ZH_HANS": "21/80MN"
  }
}
```

content.text:
No. `Key=Value,Key=Value` is **not JSON object syntax**.

- It is valid only as a **string value** in JSON, e.g.:
```json
{
  "name": "EN=21/80MN,RU=21/80МН,ZH_HANS=21/80MN"
}
```

- If you want real JSON key/value data type, use an object:
```json
{
  "name": {
    "EN": "21/80MN",
    "RU": "21/80МН",
    "ZH_HANS": "21/80MN"
  }
}
```

